### Necessário para pegar o token
# @name loginAutenticado
POST http://localhost:42000/Login HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json

{
    "UserName": "qwe",
    "Password": "qwe"
}

### Seta o token
@accessToken = {{loginAutenticado.response.body.$.token}}

### teste de buscar todas as consultas
GET http://localhost:42000/getAllConsultas HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar consulta por ID
GET http://localhost:42000/getConsultaByID/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de buscar pacientes para o select de consultas
GET http://localhost:42000/getPacientesToConsultas HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### teste de inserção de consulta
POST http://localhost:42000/insertConsulta HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "dataconsulta": "2026-11-10",
    "medico": "Dr. Paulo Lima",
    "motivo": "Avaliação cardiológica",
    "valor": 400.00,
    "pacienteid": 3
}

### teste de atualização de consulta
PUT http://localhost:42000/updateConsulta/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
    "dataconsulta": "2026-10-05",
    "medico": "Dra. Ana Souza",
    "motivo": "Consulta de rotina - check-up",
    "valor": 260.00,
    "pacienteid": 1
}

### teste de remoção de consulta
DELETE http://localhost:42000/deleteConsulta/1 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
